<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Suncor started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Suncor started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers analyst Paul Cheng started coverage of Canada's Suncor Energy Inc Friday with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We recommend purchase of the stock, with a 12-18 month price target of C$46-C$51 per share,&quot; he wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We estimate Suncor will enjoy rapid production and reserve growth well into the next decade -- oil sands, conventional oil and gas, etc.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were off 1/8 to 27 in New York.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
